Norinth Logger SDK
Copyright 2026 Norinth

This product includes software developed at Norinth.

The Norinth Logger SDK is the open client component of the Norinth AI
governance system. It captures AI telemetry inside a vendor's own
infrastructure, redacts and hashes content by default, optionally signs
event payloads, and transmits them over the documented Norinth wire
protocol (see PROTOCOL.md).

